{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55634","headline":"永明山居诗（六十九首） 三十二 · 延寿","name":"永明山居诗（六十九首） 三十二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"万事从来只自招，安危由己路非遥。\n笙歌韵里花先落，松桧枝间云未消。\n数下磬声孤月夜，一炉香翥白云朝。\n谁人会我高栖意，门掩空庭思寂寥。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"延寿","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_55634.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55634","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}